## z2k WARP forwarded traffic.
##
## This is a standard firewall4 chain-pre include, not a firewall4 fork. It is
## inert unless z2k's reserved mark has already selected a z2ktun* route.
## WARP removes that mark/PBR before disable or not-ready convergence.
meta mark & 0x80000000 == 0x80000000 oifname "z2ktun*" accept comment "!z2k: WARP forwarded traffic"
